  "content": "\n\n<p>为《我的世界》增添超棒的全新木质方块！让你的木质建筑更上一层楼！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>新增木梁、竖纹木板与雕花木板。<br><br></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">木梁的合成方式如下：</span></h3>\n<h3><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1194493/description_03206086-8bc0-471a-bf57-f3da167f3c5d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"605\" height=\"283\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">竖纹木板的合成方式如下：</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1194493/description_58f391aa-8092-4c17-a9dc-0de17fe9cb48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"595\" height=\"287\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">雕花木板的合成方式如下：</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1194493/description_c3b4e471-a4a0-4c7b-8652-25fe747cca5e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"597\" height=\"284\"></h3>\n</div>",
